# Brakes: drives disabled at a raised pose, the motor brakes (holding
# torque x gear ratio) carry gravity; the arm stays. With J2's brake gone
# (0 Nm) the upper arm falls onto its hard stop at +90 deg.
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate.arm
home 0 20 10 30 -60 0
run 1.0
print q hits
motor 2 120 0.00035 0.02 0
run 2.0
print q hits
@expect arm.q2[1] ~ 20 0.1
@expect arm.q3[1] ~ 10 0.1
@expect arm.hits2[1] == 0
@expect arm.hits2[2] >= 1
@expect arm.q2[2] > 85
@reject ^ERROR
